## Realtime

Para `capture_sessions` (controle start/pause/stop do agente Python):

```ts
useEffect(() => {
  const channel = supabase
    .channel("session-changes")
    .on(
      "postgres_changes",
      { event: "*", schema: "public", table: "capture_sessions", filter: `user_id=eq.${userId}` },
      (payload) => {
        // atualizar estado local
      }
    )
    .subscribe();

  return () => { supabase.removeChannel(channel); };
}, [userId]);
```

